#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:1 607ef93a5b4c4298bde744080d4d8dfe
msgid "Use basic_joint_controller"
msgstr "使用 basic_joint_controller"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:3 b75b28ab14e64b239bd4b68e2fc686aa
msgid ""
"Run the joint-position controller (Home / Hold / MoveJ) from "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control)."
msgstr ""
"从 [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) 运行关节位置控制器（Home / Hold / MoveJ）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:5 53ce9da0da7840f0a79006d37614f316
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "事实来源"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:8 fe3be4d89e3f40a69f9fd24ce1e951ab
msgid ""
"Steps and topics below are from "
"[basic_joint_controller/README.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/basic_joint_controller/README.md)"
" (and [README_zh.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/basic_joint_controller/README_zh.md))."
" Do not invent extra launches or command types."
msgstr ""
"下列步骤和话题均来自 [basic_joint_controller/README.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/basic_joint_controller/README.md)（以及 [README_zh.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/basic_joint_controller/README_zh.md)）。不要编造额外的 launch 或命令类型。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:10 7c2de4497ea844e5b6e290f9eb1d3e62
msgid "`/fsm_command` is **`std_msgs/Int32`**, not `String`."
msgstr "`/fsm_command` 是 **`std_msgs/Int32`**，不是 `String`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:13 c1a6e4b8f3b34d36aca8c54b444a7564
msgid ""
"On the public `open-deploy-ws` **`arx-lift2s`** branch, "
"`basic_joint_controller` is in the README’s `colcon build --packages-up-"
"to` list (simulation and real-hardware). Lift2S **split body** / **full "
"body** are chosen in `./quick_start.sh` — see [ARX Lift "
"2S](9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) and [分体控制 vs "
"全身控制](../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md)."
msgstr ""
"在公开的 `open-deploy-ws` **`arx-lift2s`** 分支上，`basic_joint_controller` 出现在 README 的 `colcon build --packages-up-to` 列表中（仿真与真机）。Lift2S 的 **split body** / **full body** 在 `./quick_start.sh` 中选择 — 见 [ARX Lift 2S](9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) 和 [分体控制 vs 全身控制](../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:15 87bec610493e44af9aae8deefd51be06
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:17 cdef513204cb4862bc8aa5826cddade1
msgid ""
"Workspace that already contains `arms_ros2_control` (for example `open-"
"deploy-ws` after `./init_repo.sh`)"
msgstr "工作空间中已有 `arms_ros2_control`（例如执行 `./init_repo.sh` 之后的 `open-deploy-ws`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:18 a3490af664224df9894edd003e6cfba5
msgid ""
"Package built: `colcon build --packages-up-to basic_joint_controller "
"--symlink-install`"
msgstr "已编译该软件包：`colcon build --packages-up-to basic_joint_controller --symlink-install`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:20 0074e9bf21f143e28a98ccfaa0cdd1c4
msgid "Launch (README demo)"
msgstr "启动（README 演示）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:22 2fb1e19b6eb84f4188fda8ffd6a822f6
msgid ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash   # or your workspace install/"
"\n"
"\n"
"ros2 launch basic_joint_controller demo.launch.py robot:=fiveages_w1\n"
"# Head only\n"
"ros2 launch basic_joint_controller demo.launch.py robot:=fiveages_w1 "
"enable_body:=false\n"
"# Body only\n"
"ros2 launch basic_joint_controller demo.launch.py robot:=fiveages_w1 "
"enable_head:=false"
msgstr ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash   # or your workspace install/\n"
"\n"
"ros2 launch basic_joint_controller demo.launch.py robot:=fiveages_w1\n"
"# Head only\n"
"ros2 launch basic_joint_controller demo.launch.py robot:=fiveages_w1 enable_body:=false\n"
"# Body only\n"
"ros2 launch basic_joint_controller demo.launch.py robot:=fiveages_w1 enable_head:=false"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:22 f499da258d5949e88613e7c61d6baba1
msgid "Argument"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:22 545e430ec5154d329b1f7ed57bc5cd73
msgid "Default (README)"
msgstr "默认值（README）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:22 8ddb045a62634e6ea99aa40f34e8c833
msgid "`robot`"
msgstr "`robot`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:22 1723212e44f744cbb525f716fdb65759
msgid "`fiveages_w1`"
msgstr "`fiveages_w1`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:22 342d4745504f44acb462f2625bf184cc
msgid "`hardware`"
msgstr "`hardware`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:22 3768b11ce26241f8a55602de6f77d5de
msgid "`mock_components` (`gz` / `isaac` / `mock_components`)"
msgstr "`mock_components` (`gz` / `isaac` / `mock_components`)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:22 d676808b6aa24abca832431a542ea989
msgid "`enable_head` / `enable_body`"
msgstr "`enable_head` / `enable_body`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:22 93f067c744ac4844810d8268deebaf3d
msgid "`true`"
msgstr "`true`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:39 1921bc523e5846188323819263fb5b0c
msgid "Switch FSM"
msgstr "切换 FSM"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 a60df3e55a3847de8aca3bb166ee99df
msgid ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 1\"   # "
"HOLD → HOME\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 2\"   # → "
"HOLD\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 4\"   # "
"HOLD → MOVEJ (canonical)"
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 1\"   # HOLD → HOME\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 2\"   # → HOLD\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 4\"   # HOLD → MOVEJ (canonical)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 2ae7c79dcc36419590971bc12cb9a893
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 9b7d881382a44b1cb96060372c33d559
msgid "Action (README)"
msgstr "动作（README）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 9047a3ec57854801a04cf0c9f819f253
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 6b1814f7324a4b74893e8245bd728257
msgid "HOME (only from HOLD)"
msgstr "HOME（仅能从 HOLD 进入）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 66a57b3818c04b2b8157ba453bbcd02a
msgid "`2`"
msgstr "`2`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 664628a0d187406d83b518510829cbfc
msgid "HOLD (from HOME / MOVEJ)"
msgstr "HOLD（从 HOME / MOVEJ 进入）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 84fe1e656e7743359eb17671b051cecd
msgid "`4`"
msgstr "`4`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 6f838ebbeb724d15a0a1806d68b8042f
msgid "MOVEJ (only from HOLD; same canonical value as the whole-body stack)"
msgstr "MOVEJ（仅能从 HOLD 进入；与全身栈相同的规范值）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 412997679c384d07bb7bf9fa0bfb1c64
msgid "`3`"
msgstr "`3`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:41 801c8a05041443bdab1b0cc05bfcbc25
msgid ""
"MOVEJ if this controller is standalone; on mixed OCS2/WBC stacks `3` "
"means **OCS2**"
msgstr "本控制器独立运行时为 MOVEJ；在混合 OCS2/WBC 栈上 `3` 表示 **OCS2**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:54 e9b77ce209dd4122b6578c2cd3d41764
msgid ""
"MOVEJ returns only to HOLD (`2`). Full table and home-config `100`+ "
"commands: [basic_joint_controller "
"reference](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)."
msgstr ""
"MOVEJ 只能回到 HOLD（`2`）。完整表与 home 构型 `100`+ 命令见 [basic_joint_controller 参考](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:56 2196591964c24332b2a28c52bbd2529e
msgid "Command joints in MOVEJ"
msgstr "在 MOVEJ 中命令关节"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:58 5ea416cce6ed404791de4a1fd58af216
msgid "Topics are namespaced to the controller name. README example:"
msgstr "话题带控制器名称空间。README 示例："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:60 2948208c1f164c828ddcffadfdfdec6f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /my_controller/target_joint_position \\\n"
"  std_msgs/msg/Float64MultiArray \"{data: [0.1, 0.2, 0.3]}\""
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /my_controller/target_joint_position \\\n"
"  std_msgs/msg/Float64MultiArray \"{data: [0.1, 0.2, 0.3]}\""

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md:65 14df300b85c143d5a5b69b48d5ddb8b9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Type is `std_msgs/Float64MultiArray`, not `sensor_msgs/JointState`. "
"Optional trajectory: `/{controller}/target_joint_trajectory` "
"(`trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory`). Hand / waist topics: the reference "
"page (README §5–6)."
msgstr ""
"类型是 `std_msgs/Float64MultiArray`，不是 `sensor_msgs/JointState`。可选轨迹：`/{controller}/target_joint_trajectory`（`trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory`）。手 / 腰话题见参考页（README §5–6）。"

